  "releaseNotes": "● New: `DriverSettings` property: applies saved Windows driver settings (DEVMODE) in `PrintAsGraphic` and `PrintFiles`. Use it for driver-specific options the SDK doesn't expose, such as cutter, media type or darkness.\n● New: `GetDriverSettings(printerName)`: gets a printer's current driver settings without showing a dialog.\n● New: `ShowDriverSettingsDialog(printerName, ownerWindowHandle[, currentSettings])`: opens the printer driver's properties dialog and returns the selected settings.\n● New: `PrintAsGraphic` now supports `ThermalLabel.CutAfterPrinting` and `BatchCut`. Printing is split into one spooler job every `BatchCut` labels, so a driver set to cut at the end of each job cuts after every batch.\n● Fixed: `PrintAsGraphic` and `PrintFiles` could print extra copies when the same `WindowsPrintJob` instance was reused.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
